                    Get Started
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{# --- 1. HERO SECTION: The "Product Stack" --- #}
<div class="relative bg-white overflow-hidden pt-12 pb-16 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28">
