                <h1 class="text-4xl tracking-tight font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
                    <span class="block">Don't just track fees.</span>
                    <span class="block text-blue-600">Run your entire school.</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-base text-gray-500 sm:mt-5 sm:text-lg sm:max-w-xl sm:mx-auto md:mt-5 md:text-xl lg:mx-0">
                    Replace Excel sheets and manual receipts with <strong>Edus</strong>. We automate Invoicing, Inventory, Results, and ID Cards in one secure platform.
                </p>
                <div class="mt-8 sm:max-w-lg sm:mx-auto sm:text-center lg:text-left lg:mx-0">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-bold rounded-lg text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 md:py-4 md:text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1">
